//RS /// never escaping via `..`. Computed or escaping paths can't be audited at
//RS /// build time and open a supply-chain hole, so they are E0957, not file reads.
//RS /// `builtin` names the function (`embed_file` / `embed_bytes` / `find`) for the message.
